                  <p><b><i>reportable offender</i></b> means a person:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-3__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>whose name is entered on a child protection offender register (however described) of a State or Territory; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-3__qstr-1__para-b">
