            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-5">
              <num>18</num>
              <heading>After subsection 16(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-5__qstr-1__subsec-1A">
                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>If a competent authority makes a request under subsection 13(1A) in relation to a person, <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> must order the surrender of the person’s foreign travel documents.</p>
                  </content>
